ingle `gross` binding that captures \"amount before deductible\". The clause and the deduction are now visible on adjacent lines.\n4. **Removed redundant ternary** — `isHighEnchant ? halfPay : (isDragon ? fullPay : fullPay)` collapsed to `isHighEnchant ? damage.amount * 0.5 : damage.amount`, with deduction applied once at the end.\n\n**Rules applied** (in priority order):\n- **Rule 1 (Tests Pass)**: ✅ 30/30 tests still green.\n- **Rule 2 (Reveals Intent)**: ✅ `gross` (pre-deductible amount) + `DAMAGE_DEDUCTIBLE` (named constant) read like the spec.\n- **Rule 3 (No Duplication)**: ✅ Removed the dead `isDragon` ternary branch — both arms were identical, so the dragon material clause was duplicating the default behavior.\n- **Rule 4 (Fewest Elements)**: ✅ One ternary instead of two; three fewer local bindings (`isDragon`, `halfPay`, `fullPay`).\n\n**Mass change**: 36 → 27 for `processClaim` body (−9, ~25% reduction).\n\n**Tests**: All passing (30 passed, 29 todo).\n\nRefactor complete — ready for the next Red phase."}],"details":{"mode":"single","agentScope":"both","projectAgentsDir":"/home/experimenter/experiments/runs/2026-07-25_02-01-15_claim-office-example-mapping_v6.2.1-phase-continuation-pi_minimax-m3-no-thinking/.pi/agents","results":[{"agent":"refactor","agentSource":"project","task":"Test file: src/policy.spec.ts\nImplementation file: src/policy.ts\nPassing tests: 7 (createPolicy tests + first processClaim test)\nRecent Green phase: Implemented processClaim to find item by type, apply high-enchantment (>=8 → 50%) clause, dragon material clause, deduct 100 per damage, cap at remainingCap.\n\nRefactor the implementation while keeping all tests green.\n\nRun autonomously, return when done.","exitCode":0,"messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Task: Test file: src/policy.spec.ts\nImplementation file: src/policy.ts\nPassing tests: 7 (createPolicy tests + first processClaim test)\nRecent Green phase: Implemented processClaim to find item by type